### 1 cli query attributes.x.md diagnostics | select {line, severity, code, message} --json
$ xmd query attributes.x.md diagnostics | select {line, severity, code, message} --json --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00
exit 0
--- stdout
[
  {
    "code": "attribute",
    "line": 1,
    "message": "@timer requires a named stopwatch or countdown, e.g. @timer(focus)",
    "severity": "error"
  },
  {
    "code": "property",
    "line": 2,
    "message": "Module timer.property: Unknown timer property 'bogus'",
    "severity": "error"
  }
]

